            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a method of assembling a drug delivery device (1, 101),wherein the drug delivery device (1, 101) comprises a control subassembly and a drive subassembly (1.1, 101.1),wherein the drive subassembly (1.1, 101.1) comprises a plunger (10, 110), a drive spring (9, 109) and a rear case (2.2),wherein the control subassembly comprises a cap (11), a needle shroud (7, 307) and a front case (2.1),wherein during assembly, a syringe (3) with an attached needle (4, 104) and a protective needle sheath (5) is inserted into the control subassembly in the distal direction, andwherein afterwards, the drive subassembly (1.1, 101.1) is inserted into the control subassembly in the distal direction.</p>
            </abstract>
